==== Opening the case ====

**Note:** This will void your warranty!

To open the case, undo the 4 recessed PH-1 screws on the bottom. Once the screws are undone, pry outwards and upwards between the top and the shell of case with a plastic spudger at the clips, as marked in the picture. 
Start from the back - there is a single clip in the center. Pry it apart and hold it open using plastic picks. Work your way around the sides using the picks, and then finally undo the two clips in the front.

